<title>UK: Kvaerner unit wins $300 mln Asia contract.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner unit wins $300 mln Asia contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>International engineering group Kvaerner said its Swedish subsidiary Kvaerner Pulping AB has been awarded a contract for two fiberlines and an optional third by an Asian customer.</p>
<p>The value of the contract for three lines, each with a capacity of 500,000 tonnes per year, is $300 million and is the largest single order ever received by Kvaerner Pulping.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
